{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED THE QUEEN is an active incremental game with a focus on strategic play and synergy-building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/f5b5bf7c0933dd37ed90dcf1feecff31.poster.avif?t=1769356394\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/f5b5bf7c0933dd37ed90dcf1feecff31.webm?t=1769356394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/f5b5bf7c0933dd37ed90dcf1feecff31.mp4?t=1769356394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your colony, hatch a wide variety of specialized workers of unique shapes and sizes to tackle different jobs around the hive, with the ultimate goal to obtain and feed an ever-increasing amount of food to your Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/501d66edc6884ebd18555f16f3f2f81c.poster.avif?t=1769356394\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/501d66edc6884ebd18555f16f3f2f81c.webm?t=1769356394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/501d66edc6884ebd18555f16f3f2f81c.mp4?t=1769356394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct unique buildings and hatch various types of workers,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce, gather, combine different types of foods with different values, effects and attributes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your production: find the right balance between production and delivery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply status effects for unique improvements,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your queen to obtain a limited resource used to unlock the most advanced upgrades,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and spend DNA points in the genetics talent tree,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, experiment, and perfect  different builds,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach higher feeding rates and advance the species to the next step of its evolution!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute hand-drawn art-style. Entirely human-made. :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135750?t=1769356394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135750?t=1769356394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/3fa186b2c8e579d6363f1909c3ce642b2e8c69e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769356394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/3fa186b2c8e579d6363f1909c3ce642b2e8c69e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769356394","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED THE QUEEN is an active incremental game with a focus on strategic play and synergy-building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_c